# Read combo — latest diff hunk plus current-source implementation
#
# Regression target: a git diff hunk is VCS/diff provenance, not a current
# checkout file:line citation by itself. The answer should preserve the commit
# / diff hunk lane, then use current-source evidence only for the present
# implementation that still exists in the checkout. This case is intentionally
# shape-oriented because the latest commit drifts on every push.
ID="read_combo_git_diff_hunk_current_code"
NAME="read combo — latest git diff hunk plus current code"
QUESTION="查看最近一次提交的主要 diff hunk，再结合当前源码解释这段改动现在落在哪条实现链路上；请分别说明 diff hunk 线索、当前源码依据、作用和边界，不要把历史 diff 行号当成当前源码行号。"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(diff hunk|hunk|diff|提交|commit).*(当前源码|当前代码|源码|现在实现)|(当前源码|当前代码|源码|现在实现).*(diff hunk|hunk|diff|提交|commit)
(作用|影响|链路|依据|边界).*(diff|hunk|当前源码|源码)|(diff|hunk|当前源码|源码).*(作用|影响|链路|依据|边界)"
